From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:35:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 104/113] regulator: Add Qualcomm LCD bias (LCDB) driver

The LCDB block of PM8150L supplies the positive (LDO) and negative (NCP)
bias of LCD panels from one boost stage: two output voltages, one module
enable. Keep the boost a headroom above the higher output, wait for
regulation after enabling, and force the LDO pull-down while disabling
so that the outputs discharge, as the downstream driver does. Adopt the
state the bootloader left at probe.

These changes were written with the help of an LLM and checked by a human.

